Upstream provided the repo layout (`workflows/`, `drivers/`, `docs/`), the
API-format workflow convention, the `POST /prompt` + poll `/history` driver
pattern, the strip-cell slicer, the OpenPose/depth render helpers in `tools/`,
and the `comfyui_vram_helpers` custom nodes. Its W1 (Qwen-Image-Edit + ControlNet
pose edit) workflow is the direct basis for this fork's `identity_pass.json`.

Upstream's LICENSE is retained unmodified. Modifications made in this fork are
described in the "Game-Dev fork" section of README.md and are covered by the same
MIT terms.

