Model weights
-------------
Every model this fork downloads is Apache-2.0 and ungated; repo, revision,
filename, size, sha256 and licence for each are recorded in gpu/models.lock.
Attribution for the weights belongs in game-02-tactical-rpg/CREDITS.md, which is
generated from asset sidecars - not hand-maintained here.

Container image: mmartial/comfyui-nvidia-docker (MIT).
Custom nodes: nunchaku-tech/ComfyUI-nunchaku (Apache-2.0),
alexopus/ComfyUI-Image-Saver (MIT).


